  viva:[["What is the three-point pressure principle?","One force at the apex of a deformity and two counterforces at either end, used to correct or control a joint."],["Which orthosis is used for radial nerve palsy?","A cock-up (wrist extension) splint, with a dynamic outrigger if finger extension is needed."],["Name an orthosis for flaccid foot drop.","Posterior leaf spring AFO."]],
